WEBVTT

00:12:26.498 --> 00:12:31.279
You know, I think if you asked
most people that worked there

00:12:31.303 --> 00:12:34.564
they'll tell you
about how amazing the team was,

00:12:34.588 --> 00:12:36.952
and that it was some
of the most incredible people

00:12:36.976 --> 00:12:38.349
they ever got to work with.

00:12:38.373 --> 00:12:40.848
And I really think
people liked being at work.

00:12:41.507 --> 00:12:42.722
And yeah, so I think

00:12:42.746 --> 00:12:47.348
they may have put a little bit more
of themselves out there

00:12:47.372 --> 00:12:50.404
that led to a little bit more
of that draining and exhaustion,

00:12:50.428 --> 00:12:54.554
but I think people were pretty stoked
for the work they were doing

00:12:54.578 --> 00:12:56.444
and the people they were doing it with.

00:12:56.468 --> 00:12:57.755
AG: So it sounds like then

00:12:57.779 --> 00:13:00.064
you don't feel that
they were getting exploited,